WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.956
The rich text editor has an AI Assistant to help you write. You stay in charge of every word.

2
00:00:07.956 --> 00:00:20.343
Write a sentence in the editor, and select it.

3
00:00:20.343 --> 00:00:29.143
Open AI Assistant in the toolbar. Choose what you want, for example to fix the spelling or to summarize.

4
00:00:29.143 --> 00:00:36.179
Read every suggestion before you use it. Check facts, names and numbers yourself.
